@startuml
title ASII-13 - Semana 5: evolucion futura evaluada

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

rectangle "ACTUAL: monolito modular Laravel" as Current {
  [ASII-13\nregistro y evaluacion] as Module
  [JWT + TenantMiddleware + RBAC comun] as Security
  database "HOSPITAL\nvital_signs" as Hospital
  Module --> Security
  Module --> Hospital
}

rectangle "FUTURO / NO IMPLEMENTADO" as Future {
  [Contrato interno estable] as Contract
  [Evento VitalSignAlertDetected] as Event
  [Outbox transaccional] as Outbox
  [Worker / cola] as Worker
  [Consumidor de notificaciones] as Notifications
  [Posible servicio de signos vitales\nsolo con metricas que lo justifiquen] as Microservice

  Contract --> Event
  Event --> Outbox
  Outbox --> Worker
  Worker --> Notifications
  Contract ..> Microservice : posible extraccion
}

Current --> Future : evolucion gradual\nno es implementacion actual

note bottom of Future
La extraccion se evaluaria ante alto volumen,
dispositivos conectados, multiples consumidores,
end note

@enduml
